              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Does the ProForm Carbon Pro 9000 have decline?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                No. The current Carbon Pro 9000 inclines from 0 to 12% with no decline. The older Pro 9000 declined to -3%, which is one way to tell them apart.
              </p>
