              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What motor does the ProForm Carbon Pro 9000 have?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                ProForm rates it at 3.6 CHP, and Treadmill Review Guru and T3 give the same figure. The motor is covered for two years. ProForm’s CHP figures are laboratory ratings that do not denote operational horsepower in household use.
              </p>
